{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cde7f45c38637d54b7650abc58d8a23f5e69f1083d46017cafe7985af0a68d81", "ja": "（クリスマスをイメージしたPVの撮影が終わった。\nこれが終わると、いよいよクリスマス公演だな…）", "zh": "（以圣诞节为主题的PV拍摄结束了。等这个结束后，终于就要到圣诞公演了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "47c1bfb563e0bce3003d0a76bc9d17e77367dc1d790364613731eda6b5bc86d3", "ja": "{$P$}さん、撮影、どうでしたか～。\nちゃんと、クリスマスしていたでしょうか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，拍摄感觉怎么样～。\n有好好拍出圣诞的感觉吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1002_p", "source_sha256": "65815bab4f94cb7ae1fc7961c3fa1e44d740eee8195b37acff9a78bc4fff6031", "ja": "おつかれさま、美也。ああ、大丈夫だよ。編集で\n色々効果がつく予定だから、仕上がりが楽しみだな！", "zh": "辛苦了，美也。啊，没问题。因为预计会在剪辑时加上各种效果，所以很期待成片啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "a45f3314a466c9aaf3b2d4eef0e77965e16d8a5516508809e0dc354512d9c39d", "ja": "そうなんですか～。\nどんなPVになるか、今から楽しみですね～。", "zh": "原来是这样啊～。\n真期待会拍出什么样的PV呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "ee3ec064dbb2838d6ff5ce0c8f93eb21f7465c1f61c973e3364f4d902d5a6e9a", "ja": "今日は撮影でしたけど、クリスマスツリーの飾り付け、\nとっても楽しかったですよ～。", "zh": "今天拍摄了，不过装饰圣诞树特别开心哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1005_p", "source_sha256": "122dc1b314422fc4639390e38beac6ead24517c3175e25496bbda9fd25495ae7", "ja": "そうか……じゃあ今度は、\n劇場のツリーの飾り付けでもしてみるか？", "zh": "这样啊……那下次要不要试着装饰一下剧场的圣诞树？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "3bbf92083dff1be853fa80e13ba32c7a4896c4c25e5596c5aa05dab573e22a9b", "ja": "お～、それはいい考えですな～。劇場のみんなで\n飾り付けをしたら、にぎやかなツリーになりますね～。", "zh": "哦～这个主意不错呢～让剧场的大家一起\n装饰的话，树一定会变得热热闹闹的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "e4b7e5fbe060ff2fae0832ea9c1bbf2eaad875258381624f71c39a68ff189440", "ja": "ツリーに飾るオーナメントも、\n好きなものを持ってきて……きっと楽しいですよ～。", "zh": "挂在圣诞树上的装饰品，也带上自己喜欢的东西来……一定会很开心的哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5eb045bc61cb1efc6b7615b9e2908d0dff02eef37353e6ee7b3fc337aa10002c", "ja": "ひとりにつきひとつ飾りを飾っても、52個か……\n闇鍋ならぬ、闇ツリーになりそうだな。", "zh": "就算每人挂一个装饰品，也有52个了……这下不是盲锅，而是“盲树”了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "afaf709960d4c33f58cdd5db9474c82bfd106d78e6f3eee6f1f4ff008a12185e", "ja": "それなら、テーマを決めてみてはどうですか～？\nモチーフは何を飾るとか、色は何色にするとか……。", "zh": "那样的话，不如定个主题怎么样～？\n比如要装饰什么样的图案，或是采用什么颜色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "30f791af4941fab1937f076024c25e88b5e5ca91e3d589bd9512857a984db46a", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\nどんなツリーが好きですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n喜欢什么样的圣诞树呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c25713ac8e0a5ea10a3181c779d919279bba958081119f71e6985f558d979824", "ja": "どんなツリー……と言われると難しいな。\n美也は、どんなのが好きなんだ？", "zh": "要说喜欢什么样的树……还真有点难回答啊。美也，你喜欢什么样的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "f64b2602266544f752d5e356f5e2cc737b32f4317f02095d290efcaae978840e", "ja": "私は、そうですね～。\n今日のツリーも、とっても素敵でしたけど……。", "zh": "我嘛～嗯……今天的圣诞树也非常漂亮，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "baf8c7a3dc69724fdcddd6865b9333643027eadb0d10ebce1c239c67429048e3", "ja": "私が飾るなら、やっぱり、\n白いツリーにするかもしれません～。", "zh": "如果是我来装饰的话，感觉还是会选白色的圣诞树呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2227bc45588e335409b4965947b94b0c8831977d951876e0c2e2b44c6b121893", "ja": "白いツリー？", "zh": "白色的圣诞树？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "d2f1989d7003de01fff6ade0568133d513246ecffd56f04a9614a6a55581381f", "ja": "はい～。クリスマスに、真っ白な\n雪が降りますようにって、お願いするんですよ～。", "zh": "是的～这是为了祈愿圣诞节能下场纯白的雪～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "23011339ece6a1ea02fe872dea84365b1b17195e57057a22f8aca70afbfd509a", "ja": "そうしたら、また、雪だるまが作れますからね～。", "zh": "这样的话，就又能堆雪人了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "082a90c0a9e50fc6c937a2a8f4a1500fd56a8d0d829c75f068712c3d538ff8e8", "ja": "たくさん積もったら、今度は劇場のみんなや\nお客さんとも一緒に、作れるかもしれません～。", "zh": "要是积得很多的话，下次说不定就能和剧场的大家以及客人们一起堆了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4ff19e60a80c6e381d9b9ed7275a835b5ea37f0ee4caad63c0c525c821b1309a", "ja": "なるほど……ホワイトクリスマスになるように、\nツリーで願掛けするのか。", "zh": "原来如此……是要向圣诞树许愿，\n希望能迎来白色圣诞啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b1c05d0c57c0183a339c242c873d70f1be4a8a4de7842eadb291e234d3a4d023", "ja": "ちょっと七夕みたいだけど……\nロマンチックで、いいかもしれないな。", "zh": "虽然有点像七夕……不过很浪漫，或许也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "2c63ef29e8c14a6ade97d1fa14f8c259f5ae6c6bd05d993bd20e68a8aed09a99", "ja": "じゃあ、いつでも白いツリーが作れるように、\n飾りをたくさん用意しておきましょう～。", "zh": "那么，为了随时都能做出白色圣诞树，\n先准备好多装饰品吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0134_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "111af5b2c9c7e78057777693b7d61f3cd67d33005633083e6901ccbb9d07a41c", "ja": "私と{$P$}さんのお願いが届いて、\nクリスマスに雪が降るといいですな～。ふふふ♪", "zh": "希望我和{$P$}先生的愿望能够实现，圣诞节能下雪就好了呢～呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
